{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109124558434-1109_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261109163706\"/><p>翠杭樓一單位起火冒煙。</p><p>觀塘發生火警。今午(9日)12時26分，翠屏南邨多名居民報案，指翠杭樓一單位起火冒煙。消防接報派出一隊煙帽隊及開動一條喉灌救，火勢於12時44分被撲熄，事件中無人受傷。根據調查，火警懷疑涉及外置充電器(俗稱「尿袋」)起火，並無可疑。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.377110+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T04:45:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:00.918924+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:37.866893+00:00","content_hash":"2c5ae14aa4b5a42a689969871dcd0d6960e6712b2da6c40bbdb033ecacb6c8f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.377110+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}